Hi [Manager's Name],

It has been 30 days since [New Starter's Name] joined your team!

To help us measure our hiring effectiveness and support you with early onboarding, please take a moment to complete the 30-Day Quality of Hire Check-in Survey.

- **Link to survey:** https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf336N9cdHhJcT3zgb5NSfgILcjIrOvzAQp3xrxZkXWYVjsQg/viewform?usp=header

