**What it covers:** Initial role and culture fit, early productivity, and identifying any quick onboarding gaps where HR can support you.

Your feedback is invaluable in ensuring we set both you and your new team member up for long-term success. Please try to complete this by [Date - e.g., end of the week].

Thank you for your time,

[Your Name/HR Team]

